#, fuzzy
msgid "A URL field on each document leading back to the application here, created in Paperless if missing. Leave blank for none."
msgstr "URL-i väli igal dokumendil, mis viib tagasi siinse kandideerimise juurde; luuakse Paperlessis, kui puudub. Jätke tühjaks, kui ei soovi."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "API token"
msgstr "API tõend"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Custom field for the application's link"
msgstr "Kohandatud väli kandideerimise lingi jaoks"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "From your Paperless profile. Stored encrypted; never shown again."
msgstr "Teie Paperlessi profiilist. Salvestatakse krüpteeritult; ei näidata enam kunagi."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Give the whole address, beginning with https://."
